# Cursor Rules — zidanfath_codebase

Flutter project dengan Clean Architecture + GetX.

## Skills — Baca Sebelum Mengerjakan Task

Panduan lengkap ada di `.agents/skills/`. Baca file SKILL.md yang relevan sebelum membuat atau mengubah kode.

### Skill yang Tersedia

```
.agents/skills/
├── new-feature/           # Panduan lengkap membuat fitur baru (BACA INI DULU)
├── project-structure/     # Struktur folder + naming convention
├── clean-architecture/    # Prinsip arsitektur + dependency rule
├── entity/                # Domain entity (pure Dart)
├── repository/            # Abstract interface + implementasi
├── usecase/               # UseCase<T, Params>
├── model/                 # Model extends Entity + fromJson
├── api-service/           # DioClient: noAuth vs auth
├── binding/               # DI wiring order
├── controller-reactive/   # BaseController + .obs + Obx
├── controller-builder/    # BaseBuilderController + GetBuilder
├── controller-pagination/ # BasePaginationController<T>
├── screen/                # GetView<T> + Obx/GetBuilder
├── routing/               # routes.dart + navigation.dart
├── environment/           # .env → Endpoint
├── networking/            # DioClient, authClient, refresh token
├── storage-get/           # GetStorage + StorageValue
├── storage-secure/        # SecureStorage + SecureStorageKey
├── state-management/      # Obx vs GetBuilder, Rx types
├── components-atoms/      # CustomButton, CustomText
├── components-molecules/  # CustomCachedImage, PaginationListView
├── theme/                 # RkTheme, colorScheme
├── responsive/            # Responsive widget + context extension
├── json-parser/           # JsonParser isolate
├── firebase/              # FCM + RemoteConfig
├── mqtt/                  # MqttService
├── lifecycle/             # AppLifecycleService
├── notifications/         # ShowNotificationHelper
├── permissions/           # PermissionHandler
├── error-handling/        # Failure, Either, GlobalErrorHandler
├── testing/               # Mockito + @GenerateMocks
└── helpers/               # Logger, Snackbar, Dialog, Rupiah
```

## Rules

### Arsitektur
- Domain layer: TIDAK boleh import Flutter, Dio, GetX, storage package apapun
- Controller: selalu gunakan `callUseCase()` dari BaseController
- DI order: Storage → ApiService → Repository(abstract) → UseCase → Controller
- URL: selalu `Endpoint.{service}.{action}`, tidak hardcode

### State
- Default: `BaseController` + `.obs` + `Obx`
- Targeted: `BaseBuilderController` + `update([id])` + `GetBuilder`
- Pagination: `BasePaginationController<T>` + `PaginationListView<T>`

### Storage
- Token, credentials → `SecureStorage` → key di `SecureStorageKey`
- Theme, version, env → `GetStorage` → key di `StorageValue`

### UI Components
- Text → `CustomText(fontType: FontType.xxx)` bukan `Text()`
- Button → `CustomButton(title, onPressed)` bukan `ElevatedButton()`
- Image URL → `CustomCachedImage()` bukan `Image.network()`

### Error
- Repository catch block → `return Left(ServerFailure(message))`
- Controller → `callUseCase(onSuccess: ..., onFailure: ...)`

### Naming
- File: snake_case — `product_entity.dart`, `get_products_usecase.dart`
- Class: PascalCase — `ProductEntity`, `GetProductsUseCase`
- Binding file: `{feature}.controller.binding.dart`
